{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14103102","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14103102","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1410310201:1":{"text":"ったく……よりによって気分が最悪なときに<style=\"highlight\">地表人</style>と出くわすとは。","source_cn":"啧……赶在我心情最差的时候撞见了<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x434815D6A431C33C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410310202:1":{"text":"なんだって！？オレら地表人の建てた家がなかったら、今頃アンタらは、まだキノコの下で暮らしてたんだぞ！","source_cn":"不懂礼貌的尖耳朵！要是没有我们这些地表人给你建房子，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D48335CA7788521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410310203:1":{"text":"き、貴様！魔法に嫌われた地表の落伍者が！よくも私にそのような暴言をっ！","source_cn":"什、什么……区区一个被魔法厌嫌的地表弃民！竟敢对我语出狂言！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x706AE138640E3EF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410310204:1":{"text":"はっ、レンガ一個すら持ち上げられないひ弱が何言ってんだ。アンタが呪文を唱え終える前に、オレの大砲を撃ち込んでやるよ！","source_cn":"哼，砖头都搬不动的废物，会魔法有什么用？在你把咒语念完...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D983C13878C2409","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410310205:1":{"text":"衛兵！衛兵っ！今すぐ<shk>こいつを殺せ</shk>！","source_cn":"卫兵……卫兵！<shk>快杀了她！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD3B9E7A01021C65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410310206:2":{"text":"すまないが、今は公務中だ。邪魔をしないでもらいたい。","source_cn":"这位大人，我在执行公务，别妨碍我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1720872673F2EF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410310207:1":{"text":"何だと！？貴様まで――ん？誰かと思えば、<style=\"highlight\">サリエ殿下</style>のお気に入りのインドラ隊長じゃないか。","source_cn":"好大的口气！让我看看——呵，原来是<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x068FCB7FD8A244A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410310208:1":{"text":"あの人が地表人のことを気にかけるはずがない。どうせ、どこぞの宴で酒に酔いしれているのだろう？","source_cn":"沙利叶殿下怕是又在哪个宴会中饮酒作乐吧？他怎么会管地表...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2709E60478DC4B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410310209:1":{"text":"私はこの者たちを<style=\"highlight\">エイン様</style>のもとに連れて行くのだ。彼らの処遇はあの方がお決めになる。","source_cn":"地表人之事归由<style=highlight>奎茵冕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94C27876CE6DDE10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410310210:1":{"text":"サリエ殿下の部下である貴様がエイン様に？はっ！いつから<style=\"highlight\">三長老</style>はそんな良好な関係になったんだね？","source_cn":"你说……带人面见奎茵冕下，别是借口吧！什么时候<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA856447D80EDCDE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410310211:1":{"text":"何が言いたい？長老方は常に力を合わせてサロクディアを守っておられる。","source_cn":"三位长老精诚合作，共同拱卫萨洛克兰。你此话何意？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18D2EAF0C303D77F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410310212:1":{"text":"貴様、エイン様をどなたと心得ている！地表人を大司祭様に会わせるなど……","source_cn":"你、你——你把奎茵冕下当什么了？这些地表弃民也配面见大祭司？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BA5984ACC219C94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410310213:1":{"text":"地上に関する事柄はすべてエイン様の管轄だ。お前は王都の法に異を唱えるのか？","source_cn":"律法有言，地表事宜均交由奎茵冕下。你在质疑律法吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A2293A167A7B73B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410310214:1":{"text":"なっ！？平民の分際で、この私を脅すつもりか！サリエ殿下に気に入られているからといって、思い上がるなよ！","source_cn":"还敢威胁我……你这平民出身的卑贱者！别以为攀上了沙利叶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x717ABD721677E537","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410310215:1":{"text":"いや、今はそれよりも、私の霊水が、女王陛下より賜った恵の霊水が盗まれたのだ！","source_cn":"听着，我的灵露被偷了！有人抢走了女王赐予我的恩典！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25A21F9824C83D2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410310216:1":{"text":"地表人はどうでもいい！さっさと私の霊水を取り返してこい！","source_cn":"这才是大事，比几个不祥的地表人重要得多！你给我把恩典灵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC2145D80F50FBAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410310217:1":{"text":"それなら、栄光の演武場にいる私の部下に言うといい。彼らが対応してくれる。","source_cn":"请移步荣光演武场，那里有我的属下正在执勤，他们会为你排...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F55C5E792526D4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410310218:1":{"text":"よ、よくもこの私にぞんざいな態度を……今すぐサリエ殿下に報告してやる！","source_cn":"混账东西！你是在打发我吗？我现在就过去找沙利叶殿下——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90D1459D5EE0379C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410310219:1":{"text":"貴様のような身の程知らずの部下を、あの人がどう処分するか見ものだな！","source_cn":"看看他怎么处理你这个不知天高地厚的手下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97931E01CCD3E01C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410310220:1":{"text":"好きにするがいい。","source_cn":"请便。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21B99ECF494D9914","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410310221:1":{"text":"今に見ていろよ！王都を追放されてから泣きついても遅いからな！","source_cn":"等着瞧吧！你被逐出王城的时候可别来我面前下跪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x278F939F1B7A54EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:怒气冲冲的贵族":{"text":"不機嫌な貴族","source":"怒气冲冲的贵族","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"ゾーヤ","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"インドラ","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":3}}